                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Adventure-strategy game where you explore open wastelands, engage in turn-based combat against mutants, and enlist the help of rescued dogs and cats\n\n✅ Strong emphasis on interpretation,you discover the meaning of events and the environment for yourself\n✅ Effective use of sound, silence and ambient audio heighten the sense of isolation\n✅ Open-world exploration\n✅ Mechanics for freeing animals that can assist in combat\n✅ Interesting blend of strategy, survival, and exploration\n✅ Original concept featuring dogs and cats fighting alongside the player\n✅ Well-executed graphics\n\n❌Minimal mechanics, there are few challenges, puzzles, or complex gameplay elements\n❌Large areas with sparse content\n❌Lack of clear objectives or a storyline\n\n✅✅ Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [strike] Mediocre [/strike], [strike] Decent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for tested game and indie games)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
